# Boss_Harley_LobAtPlayer: no target (ruling 5, 2), at its first call (TAS f5765: Harley on the
# raised pole, a4 = her speed block): $10(a4) = 0, so no projectile. A real state: the script's
# target ops clear $10(a4) when no player can be targeted (Op2_SwapPlayerTarget's clr.w $10(a4)
# at $002E16: e.g. the player between lives).

case no_target
w a4 + $10 = 0
